---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About - Landscape Ideas Tips"
  description="Learn about Landscape Ideas Tips - your trusted source for practical Australian garden and landscape advice."
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">About Landscape Ideas Tips</h1>
      
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">
          Your trusted source for practical Australian landscape and garden tips, focused on the unique conditions of the Mornington Peninsula and Victoria.
        </p>

        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          We're here to help Australian homeowners and garden enthusiasts maintain beautiful, healthy outdoor spaces. Whether you're tackling lawn care, garden beds, hedges, or seasonal maintenance, we provide practical, actionable advice you can trust.
        </p>

        <h2>What We Cover</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Lawns:</strong> Mowing schedules, edging techniques, seasonal care, and maintenance tips</li>
          <li><strong>Garden Beds:</strong> Planting guides, mulching, weed control, and bed preparation</li>
          <li><strong>Hedges & Pruning:</strong> Trimming schedules, tools, techniques, and when to hire help</li>
          <li><strong>Seasonal:</strong> Spring prep, autumn care, and year-round maintenance calendars</li>
          <li><strong>DIY vs Hire:</strong> Honest guidance on when to tackle it yourself and when to call professionals</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Peninsula Focus</h2>
        <p>
          While our tips apply across Australia, we have special insight into the Mornington Peninsula's unique climate, soil conditions, and seasonal patterns. Our advice accounts for Victorian weather, native plants, and local landscaping challenges.
        </p>

        <h2>Related Services</h2>
        <p>
          Landscape Ideas Tips is an informational tips blog, not a service provider. However, we work with trusted local partners who serve the Peninsula area:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <a href="https://mowingmagic.com.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Mowing Magic</strong></a> 
            - Professional lawn mowing, edging, and regular lawn care services
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://peninsulahardyards.com.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Peninsula Hard Yards</strong></a> 
            - Hedge trimming, garden beds, irrigation, planting, and landscape maintenance
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We share these links as a convenience to our readers. When our tips mention professional services, we'll point you to the right specialists for the job.
        </p>

        <h2>Transparency</h2>
        <p>
          We believe in honest, helpful advice. This site exists to educate and inform - not to compete with local service providers or create doorway spam. We're upfront about our relationships with Peninsula businesses and focus on delivering genuine value to our readers.
        </p>

        <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
        <p>
          Have a question or suggestion for a future tip? We'd love to hear from you. Visit our <a href="/contact">contact page</a> to get in touch.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .prose h2 {
    @apply text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-900;
  }
  .prose p {
    @apply mb-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed;
  }
  .prose ul {
    @apply mb-6 pl-6 space-y-2;
  }
  .prose li {
    @apply text-gray-700;
  }
  .prose strong {
    @apply font-semibold text-gray-900;
  }
  .prose a {
    @apply text-primary-600 hover:text-primary-800 underline;
  }
</style>
